	(text "16-channel backplane for the ADS7057 channel cards"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 22 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 5 5)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "a4858ee3-79ba-4009-9c1a-441aa3cdfcdb")
	)
	(text "One board. The FMC plug (ZedBoard LPC) is on the left. Eight SN74LVC8T245 level shifters (A side VADJ, any of 1.8 / 2.5 / 3.3 V; B side the board's 3.3 V) feed a 4 x 4 matrix of vertical 2x6 sockets. Slot k = 4 * row + column."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 32 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "71ca7ac8-214c-4da0-8442-33a683606f8a")
	)
	(text "58 lines: 18 outputs (16 CS, 2 SCLK), 40 inputs (16 WAKE_N, 16 BIG_N, 8 SDO lanes; slots 2j and 2j+1 share lane j). SCLK of slots 0-7 and 8-15 each pass a SN74LVC244A with 22 R per branch. 100 k pull-ups keep CS, WAKE_N and BIG_N high on an empty slot."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 38 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "69328a71-da87-444d-850e-3656ea1bbf72")
	)
	(text "Socket pads are not the card pin numbers (the header rows swap): card pin 1 CS -> pad 2, pin 2 BIG_N -> pad 1, pin 5 SDO -> pad 6, pin 7 SCLK -> pad 8, pin 8 WAKE_N -> pad 7. Insert each card with its components facing +X. PRSNT_M2C_L grounded, TDI tied to TDO."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 44 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "5c710ad3-21bc-4034-a889-fc2ebecce504")
	)
